{"speciesId":781,"names":{"fr":"Sinistrail","es":"Dhelmise","en":"Dhelmise","ja":"ダダリン"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Avec un bon coup d’ancre bien senti, il peut même assommer un Wailord. Son véritable corps est la partie composée de limon."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Los giros de su enorme ancla son capaces de noquear al mismísimo Wailord de un solo golpe. El alga verde es su verdadero cuerpo."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"Swinging its massive anchor, it can KO Wailord in a single blow. What appears to be green seaweed is actually its body."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"でかい 錨を ブンブン 振り回し ホエルオーさえ 一撃で ＫＯ。 緑の モズクが 本体だ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"C’est une réincarnation de l’âme des algues. Son corps est formé de détritus marins qu’il enveloppe de limon."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Es la reencarnación del espíritu de las algas que flotan a la deriva. Protege su cuerpo acoplando a las algas los desperdicios que halla en el mar."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"The soul of seaweed adrift in the waves became reborn as this Pokémon. It maintains itself with new infusions of seabed detritus and seaweed."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"海に 漂う モズクの 魂が 生まれ変わった。 海の ゴミを モズクに 絡めて 身体を 保つ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il enserre ses victimes de ses algues vertes pour aspirer leur énergie vitale. Il ne chasse que les grosses proies, comme les Wailord."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Envuelve a sus víctimas con su alga verde y les absorbe la vitalidad. Se deleita en cazar solo presas de gran tamaño, como Wailord."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It wraps its prey in green seaweed and sucks away their vitality. It only likes to go after big prey like Wailord."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"緑のモズクを 絡ませ 生気を 奪い すする。 ホエルオーみたいな 大物ばかりを 好んで 狙う。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Les algues vertes formant sa chaîne s’étendent sur plusieurs centaines de mètres. Il s’entend bien avec Venalgue."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Su alga verde se extiende en forma de cadena varios cientos de metros. Por algún motivo, se lleva bien con Skrelp."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Its chain-like green seaweed can stretch outward for hundreds of yards. For some reason, it gets along well with Skrelp."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"鎖の ような 緑の 藻屑は 数百メートルも のびる。 クズモーと なぜか 仲良し。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Ce Pokémon Spectre naît lorsque les algues dérivant au fond de l’océan se fixent sur des morceaux d’épaves de navire."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Este Pokémon de tipo Fantasma no es sino la reencarnación de las algas que flotan a la deriva y arrastran consigo vestigios de barcos hundidos."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"After a piece of seaweed merged with debris from a sunken ship, it was reborn as this ghost Pokémon."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"海底を 漂う 藻屑が 沈没船の 部品を 取りこんで ゴーストポケモンに 生まれ変わった。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il tend des guets-apens à ses proies en larguant son ancre dans la mer. Il peut absorber l’énergie vitale de grosses proies comme Wailord."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Acecha a su presa hundiendo el ancla en el mar. Es capaz de drenar la vitalidad incluso de presas del tamaño de un Wailord."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"After lowering its anchor, it waits for its prey. It catches large Wailord and drains their life-force."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"海に 錨を 下して 獲物を 待ち伏せ。 大物の ホエルオーを 捕まえて 生気を 吸い取る。"}],"varieties":[{"id":781,"moves":[{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"slam","learns":[[17,"level-up",45],[18,"level-up",45],[20,"level-up",40]]},{"name":"wrap","learns":[[17,"level-up",9],[18,"level-up",9],[20,"level-up"